    </div>
    <div class="pane"><small>PENDING DATA</small>
      <div class="pendingbox"><b>Load ratings and speeds</b><span>These values are not yet recorded from a verified source, so none are shown.</span><ul><li>C · Basic dynamic load rating</li><li>C0 · Basic static load rating</li><li>n lim · Limiting speed</li></ul></div>
