</section>

<section id="explorer">
  <h2>Explorer and workspace</h2>
  <div class="ds-rules">
    <div><b>List in HTML, filters in JS</b><span>Every published product is a real link in the page (crawlable, works without JS). JavaScript only hides rows; nothing is fetched to filter.</span></div>
    <div><b>Exact match opens</b><span>Submitting an exact code (or a search with one result) opens the workspace directly.</span></div>
    <div><b>No result is a conversion path</b><span>The typed code is carried into a WhatsApp message and the inquiry form.</span></div>
    <div><b>Workspace, desktop</b><span>A sticky panel at the inline end (left in Persian, right in English) with Overview · Drawing · Data · Documents, and a sticky WhatsApp / Call / Inquiry footer.</span></div>
    <div><b>Workspace, mobile</b><span>A 92%-height bottom sheet: the page behind becomes inert, Esc / scrim / drag-down / close all dismiss, focus returns to the row.</span></div>
    <div><b>Deep links</b><span>Opening a product sets <code>#p-slug</code> (prototype) — <code>/p/slug</code> in production, server-rendered with the workspace open. The language switch keeps the product.</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:16px">Try it: <a href="fa.html#p-22220-e" lang="fa">۲۲۲۲۰ E در نسخه فارسی</a> · <a href="en.html#p-ucp-208">UCP 208 (pending data) in English</a></p>
</section>

<section id="forms">
  <h2>Forms and contact</h2>
  <form class="form" style="max-width:720px" novalidate onsubmit="return false">
    <div class="field"><label for="x1">Full name</label><input class="input" id="x1"></div>
    <div class="field is-err"><label for="x2">Phone number</label><input class="input ltr" id="x2" aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="x2e"><span class="err" id="x2e">This field is required.</span></div>
    <div class="field field--full"><label for="x3">Part code</label><input class="input ltr" id="x3" placeholder="6205-2RS"><span class="hint">Don't know the code? Leave it empty and describe the application.</span></div>
  </form>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:12px">No price, quantity-based totals or "add to cart" anywhere. The only submit action is "Send inquiry", and WhatsApp sits beside it as an equal alternative.</p>
</section>

<section id="motion">
  <h2>Motion and reduced motion</h2>
  <div class="tbl-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Value</th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td class="mono">--t-fast</td><td class="mono">120ms</td><td>Hover and pressed states</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mono">--t</td><td class="mono">240ms</td><td>Bottom sheet, scrim</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mono">--t-slow</td><td class="mono">520ms</td><td>Fallback draw-on</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mono">--ease</td><td class="mono">cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)</td><td>Everything time-based</td></tr>
  </tbody></table></div>
  <h3>Behaviours and their drivers</h3>
  <div class="tbl-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Behaviour</th><th>Chrome / Edge, Safari 26+</th><th>Browsers without scroll timelines</th><th>Reduced motion</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><b>Drawing Set</b>: each sheet's line work draws as it enters; the process raceway extends</td><td>CSS <code>view-timeline</code>, no JS</td><td>IntersectionObserver adds <code>.is-drawn</code> once</td><td>Drawn from the start</td></tr>
    <tr><td><b>Exploded Assembly</b>: sticky stage, parts slide apart along the shaft, BOM rows and balloons light in turn, then reassemble</td><td>CSS scroll timeline animates one registered property <code>--e</code>; parts translate by <code>--e × --dx</code></td><td>One passive scroll listener, active only while the stage is on screen, sets <code>--e</code> per frame</td><td>No sticky track; static exploded drawing with all balloons and the full BOM</td></tr>
    <tr><td><b>Workspace sheet</b> (mobile)</td><td colspan="2">240 ms transform, compositor-only</td><td>Instant</td></tr>
    <tr><td><b>Scroll to explorer</b> after a search</td><td colspan="2">Smooth scroll</td><td>Jump</td></tr>
  </tbody></table></div>
  <h3>Live specimen</h3>
  <figure class="dwg" style="margin:0;max-width:520px">{% include "final.svg.j2" %}<figcaption><span>DRAW-ON · SCROLL-DRIVEN</span><span>NTS</span></figcaption></figure>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:12px">Rules: only <code>transform</code>, <code>opacity</code> and <code>stroke-dashoffset</code> animate; no parallax; no continuous rotation; nothing waits for animation to become readable; one sticky stage on the whole page.</p>
</section>

<section id="perf">
  <h2>Performance ledger</h2>
  <p class="lead">Measured on this prototype with Chromium, a 390 px phone viewport, 4× CPU slowdown and cache disabled. Numbers are compressed transfer sizes.</p>
  <div class="tbl-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Decision</th><th>Cost</th><th>Measured / effect</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  {% for r in ledger %}<tr><td>{{ r[0] }}</td><td>{{ r[1] }}</td><td>{{ r[2] }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>
</section>
</main>
</div>
